    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Good, you can sit up again. Let me tell you where I've got to. This looks most like a mild stomach bug. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together.",
