    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a mild stomach bug, and we'll watch how it goes. Small, frequent sips of fluid and keep him off nursery for two days after it stops. If he stops drinking or becomes drowsy, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. I'd like you back if he is not drinking. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?",
